{"id":53200,"date":"2026-07-09T06:28:10","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T05:28:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-parques-coimbra\/"},"modified":"2026-10-16T09:31:57","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T08:31:57","slug":"corrida-entre-parques-coimbra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-parques-coimbra\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Entre Parques Coimbra 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Entre Parques Coimbra 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida Entre Parques Coimbra 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica e acad\u00e9mica cidade de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Coimbra<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es (ADR 4 Esta\u00e7\u00f5es)<\/strong>, com o apoio da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Coimbra<\/strong>, da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Uni\u00e3o das Freguesias de Coimbra<\/strong> e o patroc\u00ednio oficial do CoimbraShopping, esta prova de terreno misto (estrada, escadas e caminhos de terra) alia o atletismo \u00e0 cultura, \u00e0 natureza e \u00e0s tradi\u00e7\u00f5es estudantis. Calcula o teu ritmo ideal na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Corridas de Estrada<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida \u00fanica \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:30<\/strong> no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Jardim da Sereia (Parque de Santa Cruz)<\/strong>, o tra\u00e7ado de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6 km<\/strong> (dispon\u00edvel em vertente de Corrida competitiva e Caminhada l\u00fadica) convida os participantes a descobrir os espa\u00e7os verdes e monumentos mais emblem\u00e1ticos da cidade dos estudantes, atravessando o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Jardim Bot\u00e2nico<\/strong>, o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Penedo da Saudade<\/strong> e a hist\u00f3rica Alta da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Universidade de Coimbra (Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO)<\/strong>, com o momento alto na subida dos <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">125 degraus das Escadas Monumentais<\/strong> ao som de Tunas e do Fado de Coimbra.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento atribui pr\u00e9mios aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina, aos tr\u00eas primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Juniores\/Seniores 18-34 anos e Masters de M\/F35 a M\/F70+) e \u00e0s tr\u00eas melhores equipas masculinas e femininas (3 atletas pontu\u00e1veis). O kit de participa\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal personalizado (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 31 de outubro), medalh\u00e3o finisher, seguro desportivo, abastecimento final e diploma digital, com balne\u00e1rios dispon\u00edveis para banhos no Pavilh\u00e3o Dr. M\u00e1rio Mexia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span cl